# rpg-pet shop catalog. Every picture is a tile of an RPG Maker MV sheet in #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets (48 px tiles). Nothing else is drawn.
# ITEM | key | label | price | sheet | col | row | w_tiles | h_tiles | kind | effect
# kind: floor (stands on the floor, blocks its cells) | wall (hangs on the wall row)
# effect: what the item DOES for the pet once the events layer reads it (v0: stored, shown, not acted on yet): sleep, eat, read, play, decor
ITEM | bed_blue     | Blue bed      | 120 | Inside_B | 0  | 10 | 1 | 2 | floor | sleep
ITEM | bed_orange   | Orange bed    | 120 | Inside_B | 1  | 10 | 1 | 2 | floor | sleep
ITEM | table_round  | Round table   |  60 | Inside_B | 0  | 12 | 1 | 1 | floor | eat
