ITEM | stool_red    | Red stool     |  25 | Inside_B | 1  | 13 | 1 | 1 | floor | decor
ITEM | bookshelf    | Bookshelf     | 150 | Inside_B | 6  | 8  | 1 | 2 | floor | read
ITEM | cupboard     | Cupboard      | 130 | Inside_B | 2  | 6  | 1 | 2 | floor | eat
ITEM | piano        | Piano         | 400 | Inside_B | 5  | 12 | 2 | 2 | floor | play
ITEM | throne_red   | Red armchair  | 220 | Inside_B | 10 | 6  | 2 | 2 | floor | decor
